{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown hero from the Kholin species is pushed to escape the imminent fate of the universe.\u00a0The Oblivion wave is destroying the whole space and time, and you need to find a way to stop it through your journey and save the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LIFTOFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lift off with your spaceship to start your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Liftoff.png?t=1749200647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRAVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between randomly generated planets to continue your journey, gaining more time to escape the wave but losing resources on your spaceship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Travel.png?t=1749200647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land to the new planet, performing a classic Moonlander-like game and trying not to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Landing1.png?t=1749200647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE BEAUTIFUL LANDSCAPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once landed, feel free to explore and unveil the secrets of the new planet, but remember not to loose too much time as the wave is constantly chasing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Landscape2.png?t=1749200647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT AND COLLECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat with multiple enemy species that want to stop you in your journey, while collecting resources to fill your spaceship fuel back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Combat.png?t=1749200647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find new items, upgrades and weapons that will help you improve in your journey</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Discover.png?t=1749200647\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RUNES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find temples and apply new runes to your weapon to make it more powerful</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Rune.png?t=1749200647\" />BELT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constantly check your belt to check how much time left you have to escape the wave, while also checking your current upgrades and weapon setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/Belt.png?t=1749200647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOOK AT THE STARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Back to your home planet, check the constelations to get permanent upgrades for your next runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/EnergyMap.png?t=1749200647\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694550?t=1749200647","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694550?t=1749200647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/97a0a65aad368737bb6f11345a6e4f9a73c2fa43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749200647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/97a0a65aad368737bb6f11345a6e4f9a73c2fa43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749200647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"descriptio